    comment: 'FFT size. NOT a live control, and no GUI could make it one: it is

      the width of a vector port, and GNU Radio fixes port widths when

      the flowgraph is built. Edit it here and re-run.

      4096 bins over 5 MS/s is 1.2 kHz per bin.'
  states:
