    label1: '''5 MS/s  (20 MB/s)'''
    option2: '10000000'
    label2: '''10 MS/s  (40 MB/s)'''
    option3: '20000000'
    label3: '''20 MS/s  (80 MB/s)'''
    option4: '61440000'
    label4: '''61.44 MS/s  (245 MB/s - raise buf first)'''
    comment: Span. Lower is better for dynamic range - see the note.
  states:
